<title>USA: PepsiCo does not know why stock active.</title>
<headline>PepsiCo does not know why stock active.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>PepsiCo Inc does not know why trading in its stock is active, a spokeswoman for the company said on Monday.</p>
<p>PepsiCo topped the NYSE most active list and was off 1-3/8 to 28-3/8.</p>
</text>
